<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>一根繩的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 用了做禮物，餘下的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 用了做裝飾。做裝飾的部分佔全繩的幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>弟弟的零用錢是哥哥的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>，妹妹的是弟弟的 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>。妹妹的零用錢是哥哥的幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
