<tr><th>#</th><th>易錯點</th><th>正確做法</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>三分數 LCM 只找兩個</strong>：分母 2,3,4 只找 LCM(2,3)=6</td><td>LCM 要包含所有分母！LCM(2,3,4)=12</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>乘除混合忘記將 ÷ 變 ×</strong>：<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>×<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>÷<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> 只算前面兩個</td><td>所有 ÷ 全部變成 ×（除數倒轉），統一處理</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>四則次序錯誤 — 先加減後乘除</strong></td><td>先×÷ 後+−，有括號最先算</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>括號內未通分</strong>：(<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>) 直接寫 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span></td><td>括號內也要先通分再計算！</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>交叉約簡時只約同分母組</strong></td><td>任何分子的公因數可以跟任何分母約</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>結果未約簡／假分數未轉帶</strong></td><td>最後一步必須檢查約簡和轉帶分數</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>應用題算式次序反映錯</strong>（漏括號）</td><td>列式時確認：題目要你先做什麼？需要用括號嗎？</td></tr>
</table>
